{"id":"vod_sn_38980","vodId":"38980","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"假面骑士01","name_cn":"假面骑士01","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/e7d6ccaf79faef6f88b91c1950f90a07.jpg"},"summary":"这是新时代骑士与人工智能的正面交锋。故事背景设定为迎来新时代的日本。引领人工智能潮流的公司——“飞电智能”，研发了一款AI机器人，并将其投入到实际运用中。它们完美融入了职场，把新时代朝着电子化的方向推进。但妄图灭绝人类的恐怖分子“灭亡迅雷站”黑了机器人的系统使之暴走。在这样的情况下，政府成立了专门针对AI犯罪的人工智能特务机关，来镇压暴走的AI机器人，维持治安。在一系列事件中，以成为搞笑艺人为目标的主角——飞电或人成了中心人物。在被炒鱿鱼的主人公面前出现了一辆无人驾驶的高档车，然后他突然间被告知，自己要继承飞电智能公司社长的宝座……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:17","playable":true,"episodeCount":46,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/jtu0AggHwz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/TcX2A2FzFH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/u4g8eMHd7C1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/4Ba3JxyHG21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/2w9WywyTkJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/wh93wf59XL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/aQKc6CM8wV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/uF7Jmy2f1J1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/rZqCmBXDtx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/8beiyxyVjJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/7kcMANbhcM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/jLb1BzKVPb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/sxLpEj1YWH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/jmbDGXra4t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https:/